VortX exact-ticket owned subtitle primary-slot publication, first-drain successor.

Base: mpv 8c67647b50059406c5c0444903597281b81516cf, after retained
platform/HTTP/audio/GPU/original-file/edition patches and
mpv-owned-subtitle-constructor.patch. The original-local-file witness property
is a prerequisite. This carries the corrected independently reviewed 16 native
paths only; no private engine or unrelated custom working-tree delta is added.

Preparation uses the bounded whole-corpus constructor off-core. Commit/revoke
retain exact positive ticket ownership. Primary OSD readers and destruction
retain native lifetime. Closing occurs before the FIRST live-core client drain;
its idempotent fallback cannot queue reapers after last-client core-thread join.
Commands use existing public node transport; no exported C ABI is introduced.

The host must still reserve original account/profile renderer ownership and
prove retirement. Native tuple equality is not host authority. Source carrier
is not compilation, runtime, packaged adoption or release acceptance. Fresh
complete builds and caller/lifetime/device gates remain required. Existing
upstream licensing applies.

